      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm trying to really kickstart my metabolism for a cut. i've been taking a ton of coffee every morning (like 5-6 cups) so i have a huge caffeine tolerance. i want to start combining caffeine with green tea extract to get a massive metabolic boost. what's the max effective dose i can take of both together in the morning to really rev things up without it being too much?",
